Priority: optional
Maintainer: Patrick Schleizer <adrelanos@whonix.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Homepage: https://www.whonix.org/wiki
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/org-ai-assisted/whonix-wiki-static
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/org-ai-assisted/whonix-wiki-static.git
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: whonix-wiki-static
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: offline static copy of the Whonix wiki
 The complete Whonix wiki rendered as self-contained static HTML/CSS/JS by
 mw-static-generator: no PHP, no database, no server-side logic at serve time,
 strict Content-Security-Policy, separate CSS/JS with no inline. Installed under
 /usr/share/doc/homepage/ for offline reading; the same tree is reusable to host
 the site online from a web server.
